      <td>Client UI State</td>
      <td>Zustand</td>
      <td>Langkah aktif pada form wizard asesmen sebelum pengguna mengirimkan data ke API.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>assessment list</code></td>
      <td>Server State</td>
      <td>TanStack Query</td>
      <td>Data berasal dari REST API; membutuhkan cache memori, <code>staleTime: 60s</code>, dan background refetch.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>course catalog</code></td>
      <td>Server State</td>
      <td>TanStack Query</td>
      <td>Katalog pelatihan/sertifikasi stabil; dikonfigurasi dengan <code>staleTime: 120s</code> dan <code>gcTime: 10m</code>.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>createAssessment</code></td>
      <td>Mutation State</td>
      <td>TanStack Query</td>
      <td>Operasi mutasi data POST; memicu invalidasi query <code>['assessments']</code> otomatis saat sukses.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>competencies CRUD</code></td>
      <td>Server State</td>
      <td>TanStack Query</td>
      <td>Data katalog industri di Admin Panel; sinkronisasi otomatis pasca mutasi PUT/DELETE.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="page-break"></div>

<h1>LAMPIRAN C: KONFIGURASI BUILD TOOLING &amp; AUTOMATED CI/CD WORKFLOW</h1>

<p><strong>1. Perintah Kunci pada <code>package.json</code>:</strong></p>
<div class="code-block">&quot;scripts&quot;: {
  &quot;dev&quot;: &quot;next dev --hostname 0.0.0.0 --port 3001&quot;,
  &quot;build&quot;: &quot;next build&quot;,
  &quot;start&quot;: &quot;next start --hostname 0.0.0.0 --port 3001&quot;,
  &quot;dev:vite&quot;: &quot;vite --host 0.0.0.0 --port 3000&quot;,
  &quot;build:vite&quot;: &quot;vite build&quot;,
  &quot;typecheck:vite&quot;: &quot;tsc -p tsconfig.app.json --noEmit&quot;,
  &quot;biome:check&quot;: &quot;biome check src vite.config.ts&quot;,
  &quot;biome:format&quot;: &quot;biome format --write src vite.config.ts&quot;,
  &quot;test&quot;: &quot;vitest run&quot;,
  &quot;test:coverage&quot;: &quot;vitest run --coverage&quot;,
  &quot;quality:gate&quot;: &quot;npm run typecheck:vite &amp;&amp; npm run biome:check &amp;&amp; npm run test:coverage &amp;&amp; npm run build:vite&quot;,
  &quot;benchmark:vite&quot;: &quot;node scripts/benchmark-vite.mjs&quot;
}</div>

<p><strong>2. Alur Eksekusi CI/CD Pipeline Otomatis:</strong></p>
<div class="code-block">GitHub Push / PR (main, master)
  │
  ▼
Ubuntu Environment Setup (Node.js 22 + npm cache)
  │
  ▼
npm ci (Instalasi dependensi terkunci)
  │
  ▼
npm run quality:gate
  ├─► tsc -p tsconfig.app.json --noEmit    (Strict Typecheck PASSED)
  ├─► biome check src vite.config.ts        (Rust Linter/Formatter PASSED)
  ├─► vitest run --coverage                 (Unit &amp; BFF Tests 100% PASSED)
  └─► vite build                            (Vite Bundle Minification PASSED)
  │
  ▼
npm run build (Next.js Production Compilation PASSED)
  │
  ▼
Upload Coverage Artifacts (coverage/)
  │
  ▼
SonarQube Cloud Scanner (0 Vulnerabilities, 0 Hotspots, Coverage &gt;= 80%)
  │
  ▼
Status: QUALITY GATE PASSED &mdash; Ready for Production Deployment</div>

</div>
